1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:08,020
To find the orders, run the reaction several times, changing one concentration at a time, and measure the initial rate.

2
00:00:08,020 --> 00:00:11,562
If doubling A doubles the rate, the order in A is one.

3
00:00:11,562 --> 00:00:13,736
If it quadruples the rate, two.

4
00:00:13,736 --> 00:00:16,184
If nothing changes, zero.

